%N A327756 Odd composite integers n such that binomial(n-1,(n-1)/2) is coprime to n.
%C A327756 Composite integer n is in this sequence if for every prime p|n, the base-p representation of (n-1)/2 is composed of digits not exceeding (p-1)/2.
%H A327756 Robert Israel, <a href="/A327756/b327756.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a>
%p A327756 filter:= n -> not isprime(n) and igcd(binomial(n-1,(n-1)/2), n) = 1:
%p A327756 select(filter, [seq(i,i=3..1000,2)]); # _Robert Israel_, Sep 06 2026
%Y A327756 Subsequence of A327755.
%K A327756 nonn,changed
%O A327756 1,1
